Additional references may be incorporated through the official governance process.

⸻

Interpretation Rule

These principles shall be interpreted as a unified philosophy rather than independent rules.

Individual principles should never be applied in ways that undermine the overall artistic vision of NVD.

The experience always takes precedence over isolated visual decisions.

⸻

Governance

This document defines the official Art Direction philosophy of the NVD Ecosystem.

It supersedes personal stylistic preferences.

Any modification requires formal approval by the NVD Board of Directors through the official governance process.

